WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.752
Show more humility
when someone's talking to you!

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.796
As someone with authority--

00:00:04.921 --> 00:00:07.298
Okay, okay! Below the knee, right?

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:10.010
Understood!

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:13.847
You fool! What is with that swing!

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:16.099
You're going to damage the ears of wheat!

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:18.560
-You said below the knee!
-What is going on?

00:00:18.643 --> 00:00:20.729
He's getting yelled at like crazy.

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:22.856
He's Olmar, the master's son.

00:00:22.939 --> 00:00:24.983
Oh, they're father and son…

00:00:25.942 --> 00:00:28.069
I can't take this anymore!

00:00:28.945 --> 00:00:33.199
For once I decide to help you out,
but all you do is nitpick on the details.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:37.746
I'm done.
I was going to work, but never mind.

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:40.832
Hey! Where do you think
you're going, Olmar?!

00:00:40.957 --> 00:00:43.585
Away from you, you old man!

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:46.671
In time, you will be inheriting this farm.

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:48.381
Act more responsibly.

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:52.719
When did I ever ask you
to let me inherit it!

00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:57.265
I'm a grown man!
I don't have time to be doing teeny-tiny

00:00:57.348 --> 00:01:00.101
insignificant jobs out in the field!

00:01:00.185 --> 00:01:01.978
I'm going to use this…

00:01:06.524 --> 00:01:07.358
Huh?

00:01:10.987 --> 00:01:15.033
-Hey, what is he doing?
-I wonder…

00:01:24.375 --> 00:01:26.503
I'll rise up the ranks with this sword!

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:29.339
-Damn it!
-Olmar! Wait, you little…

